# Reap What You Sow (windurst 29): Mashuu-Ajuu (Windurst Waters; default 429, which takes turns with his script: each
# script talk below follows a 429; Let Sleeping Dogs Lie answers him at fame level 4 and Making the Grade while
# accepted: neither here, fame 0). Each offer, reminder and repeat is a math.randomInt(1, 2) roll (the seeded script
# RNG; the other roll plays nothing or 476): the rounds below talk three times per stage and `finish-if-event` the
# answer; read the rolls with `show` and add rounds where a stage saw no event. Available: a fungus traded: nothing;
# 463, option 0: nothing; no free slot, option 3: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED, not begun; option 3: begun, the seeds.
# Accepted: 464 / 476; a fungus with gil, two fungi: nothing; no free slot: 475 (500, 131): ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED, the
# fungus kept; 475: 500 gil, the fungus taken, needToZone, completed, fame 10, the Stationery Set. Completed with
# needToZone: 478; rezoned, var 0: 479 option 0: nothing; no free slot, option 3: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED; option 3: var
# 1, the seeds. Var 1: 464 / 476; a Deathball: 477 (700): 700 gil, needToZone, fame 10, var 0 (no completion).
